{"seq":3,"slug":"presigned-url-direct-upload","title":"预签名 URL 与客户端直传","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/upload-fundamentals/presigned-url-direct-upload","wordCount":1312,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"预签名-url-与客户端直传\">预签名 URL 与客户端直传</h1><p>传统上传架构中，文件数据流经应用服务器再转存到对象存储——这条路径让应用服务器承受全部带宽压力，一个 1 Gbps 的服务器同时处理 100 个 100 MB 上传就需要近 80 秒才能消化完毕。预签名 URL（Presigned URL）彻底改变了数据流向：应用服务器只签发一个带时效性的上传凭证，客户端持凭证直接上传到对象存储，数据不再经过应用层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>预签名 URL</strong>：应用服务器使用密钥对 HTTP 请求参数签名，生成带时效性的 URL，持有者无需凭证即可执行指定操作</li>\n<li><strong>POST Policy</strong>：比 PUT 预签名更精细的控制——通过 JSON 条件约束文件大小、Key 前缀、Content-Type</li>\n<li><strong>STS 临时凭证</strong>：替代预签名 URL 的方案，向客户端签发限时限权的 AK/SK 用于 SDK 直传</li>\n<li><strong>上传回调</strong>：直传架构中应用服务器感知上传完成的机制——客户端通知 + 对象存储事件通知</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"架构对比\">架构对比</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 传统架构&#10;        C1[客户端] --&gt;|上传数据| A1[应用服务器]&#10;        A1 --&gt;|转存| S1[对象存储]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 直传架构&#10;        C2[客户端] --&gt;|1.请求凭证| A2[应用服务器]&#10;        A2 --&gt;|2.返回 presigned URL| C2&#10;        C2 --&gt;|3.直传数据| S2[对象存储]&#10;        S2 --&gt;|4.上传完成回调| A2&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 传统架构\n        C1[客户端] --&gt;|上传数据| A1[应用服务器]\n        A1 --&gt;|转存| S1[对象存储]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 直传架构\n        C2[客户端] --&gt;|1.请求凭证| A2[应用服务器]\n        A2 --&gt;|2.返回 presigned URL| C2\n        C2 --&gt;|3.直传数据| S2[对象存储]\n        S2 --&gt;|4.上传完成回调| A2\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统架构</th>\n<th>直传架构</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用服务器带宽</td>\n<td>承受全部文件流量</td>\n<td>仅处理签名请求（KB 级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>数据双跳（客户端→服务器→存储）</td>\n<td>数据单跳（客户端→存储）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水平扩展</td>\n<td>需按上传带宽扩容</td>\n<td>签名无状态，极易扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全控制</td>\n<td>集中在服务器</td>\n<td>需通过签名参数+回调校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中等（需处理 CORS、回调）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"预签名-url-的生成\">预签名 URL 的生成</h2><h3 id=\"aws-s3-签名机制\">AWS S3 签名机制</h3><p>S3 预签名 URL 使用 AWS Signature V4 算法，将操作权限编码进 URL 查询参数中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { S3Client, PutObjectCommand } from &#39;@aws-sdk/client-s3&#39;;&#10;import { getSignedUrl } from &#39;@aws-sdk/s3-request-presigner&#39;;&#10;&#10;const s3 = new S3Client({ region: &#39;us-east-1&#39; });&#10;&#10;async function generatePresignedUrl(&#10;  bucket: string,&#10;  key: string,&#10;  contentType: string,&#10;  maxSizeBytes: number,&#10;): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  const command = new PutObjectCommand({&#10;    Bucket: bucket,&#10;    Key: key,&#10;    ContentType: contentType,&#10;    // 通过 Conditions 限制上传大小&#10;    Metadata: { &#39;x-amz-meta-max-size&#39;: String(maxSizeBytes) },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return getSignedUrl(s3, command, {&#10;    expiresIn: 3600, // 1 小时有效&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { S3Client, PutObjectCommand } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@aws-sdk/client-s3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { getSignedUrl } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@aws-sdk/s3-request-presigner'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S3Client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ region: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'us-east-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generatePresignedUrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bucket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  contentType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxSizeBytes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PutObjectCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Bucket: bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Key: key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ContentType: contentType,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 通过 Conditions 限制上传大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Metadata: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x-amz-meta-max-size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxSizeBytes) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getSignedUrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s3, command, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expiresIn: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1 小时有效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>生成的 URL 形如：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"https://bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/avatar.png&#10;  ?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&#10;  &amp;X-Amz-Credential=AKIA.../20260718/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&#10;  &amp;X-Amz-Date=20260718T120000Z&#10;  &amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&#10;  &amp;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=content-type;host&#10;  &amp;X-Amz-Signature=a1b2c3d4...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>https://bucket.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/avatar.png</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x26;X-Amz-Credential=AKIA.../20260718/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x26;X-Amz-Date=20260718T120000Z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x26;X-Amz-Expires=3600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x26;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=content-type;host</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x26;X-Amz-Signature=a1b2c3d4...</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"gcs-签名-url\">GCS 签名 URL</h3><p>Google Cloud Storage 使用 V4 签名方式，概念类似但参数名不同：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from google.cloud import storage&#10;from datetime import timedelta&#10;&#10;def generate_signed_url(bucket_name: str, blob_name: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    client = storage.Client()&#10;    bucket = client.bucket(bucket_name)&#10;    blob = bucket.blob(blob_name)&#10;&#10;    return blob.generate_signed_url(&#10;        version=&quot;v4&quot;,&#10;        expiration=timedelta(hours=1),&#10;        method=&quot;PUT&quot;,&#10;        content_type=&quot;application/octet-stream&quot;,&#10;    )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> google.cloud </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> datetime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timedelta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generate_signed_url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bucket_name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, blob_name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage.Client()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.bucket(bucket_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    blob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket.blob(blob_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blob.generate_signed_url(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        expiration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hours</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PUT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        content_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/octet-stream\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"阿里云-oss-签名-url\">阿里云 OSS 签名 URL</h3><p>OSS 使用自有签名算法，通过 SDK 封装：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import &quot;github.com/aliyun/aliyun-oss-go-sdk/oss&quot;&#10;&#10;func generateSignedURL(bucketName, objectKey string) (string, error) {&#10;    client, _ := oss.New(endpoint, accessKeyId, accessKeySecret)&#10;    bucket, _ := client.Bucket(bucketName)&#10;&#10;    signedURL, err := bucket.SignURL(objectKey, oss.HTTPPut, 3600,&#10;        oss.ContentType(&quot;image/png&quot;),&#10;    )&#10;    return signedURL, err&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">github.com/aliyun/aliyun-oss-go-sdk/oss</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateSignedURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bucketName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">objectKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    client, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> oss.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">New</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(endpoint, accessKeyId, accessKeySecret)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bucket, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Bucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bucketName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    signedURL, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SignURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(objectKey, oss.HTTPPut, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        oss.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ContentType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image/png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signedURL, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"安全控制手段\">安全控制手段</h2><p>预签名 URL 本质是将部分权限下放给客户端，必须通过多层约束防止滥用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"s3-post-policy\">S3 POST Policy</h3><p>相比 PUT 类型的预签名 URL，POST Policy 提供更精细的服务端控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;expiration&quot;: &quot;2026-07-18T13:00:00.000Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;conditions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;bucket&quot;: &quot;my-uploads&quot; },&#10;    [&quot;starts-with&quot;, &quot;$key&quot;, &quot;user-uploads/&quot;],&#10;    [&quot;content-length-range&quot;, 1, 52428800],&#10;    { &quot;Content-Type&quot;: &quot;image/png&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;x-amz-algorithm&quot;: &quot;AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;x-amz-credential&quot;: &quot;AKIA.../20260718/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;x-amz-date&quot;: &quot;20260718T120000Z&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expiration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-18T13:00:00.000Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-uploads\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"starts-with\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user-uploads/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"content-length-range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">52428800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"Content-Type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image/png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"x-amz-algorithm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AWS4-HMAC-SHA256\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"x-amz-credential\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AKIA.../20260718/us-east-1/s3/aws4_request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"x-amz-date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"20260718T120000Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制维度</th>\n<th>PUT Presigned URL</th>\n<th>POST Policy</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文件大小限制</td>\n<td>不支持（需通过其他层控制）</td>\n<td><code>content-length-range</code> 条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Key 前缀限制</td>\n<td>固定 key</td>\n<td><code>starts-with</code> 条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content-Type 限制</td>\n<td>签名时固定</td>\n<td>条件中指定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多字段表单支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持元数据字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器兼容性</td>\n<td>需 CORS PUT</td>\n<td>原生 form POST</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"cors-配置\">CORS 配置</h3><p>客户端直传需要对象存储配置 CORS 允许跨域请求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;CORSConfiguration&gt;&#10;  &lt;CORSRule&gt;&#10;    &lt;AllowedOrigin&gt;https://app.example.com&lt;/AllowedOrigin&gt;&#10;    &lt;AllowedMethod&gt;PUT&lt;/AllowedMethod&gt;&#10;    &lt;AllowedMethod&gt;POST&lt;/AllowedMethod&gt;&#10;    &lt;AllowedHeader&gt;*&lt;/AllowedHeader&gt;&#10;    &lt;ExposeHeader&gt;ETag&lt;/ExposeHeader&gt;&#10;    &lt;MaxAgeSeconds&gt;3600&lt;/MaxAgeSeconds&gt;&#10;  &lt;/CORSRule&gt;&#10;&lt;/CORSConfiguration&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">CORSConfiguration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">CORSRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">AllowedOrigin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>https://app.example.com&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">AllowedOrigin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">AllowedMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>PUT&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">AllowedMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">AllowedMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>POST&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">AllowedMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">AllowedHeader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>*&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">AllowedHeader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ExposeHeader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>ETag&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ExposeHeader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">MaxAgeSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>3600&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">MaxAgeSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">CORSRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">CORSConfiguration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"上传完成回调\">上传完成回调</h2><p>客户端直传后，应用服务器如何得知上传结果？三种回调模式：</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-客户端通知\">1. 客户端通知</h3><p>客户端上传成功后主动调用应用 API 报告结果。简单但不可信——恶意客户端可能伪造通知。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-对象存储事件通知\">2. 对象存储事件通知</h3><p>S3 Event Notification / GCS Pub/Sub / OSS 事件通知将对象创建事件推送给应用：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    C[客户端] --&gt;|直传| S3[S3 Bucket]&#10;    S3 --&gt;|s3:ObjectCreated| SQS[SQS 队列]&#10;    SQS --&gt;|消费| App[应用服务器]&#10;    App --&gt;|更新状态| DB[(数据库)]\">graph LR\n    C[客户端] --&gt;|直传| S3[S3 Bucket]\n    S3 --&gt;|s3:ObjectCreated| SQS[SQS 队列]\n    SQS --&gt;|消费| App[应用服务器]\n    App --&gt;|更新状态| DB[(数据库)]</pre><h3 id=\"3-s3-object-lambda-cloudfront-function\">3. S3 Object Lambda / CloudFront Function</h3><p>在访问路径上拦截并处理——适合读取时的即时转换，不适合上传回调。</p>\n<p>生产推荐组合：客户端通知（快速反馈 UI）+ 事件通知（权威确认）。两者结果不一致时以事件通知为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预签名与分片上传的结合\">预签名与分片上传的结合</h2><p>对于大文件直传，可以为每个分片生成独立的预签名 URL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function initiateMultipartDirect(bucket: string, key: string, totalParts: number) {&#10;  // 1. 服务端创建 multipart upload&#10;  const { UploadId } = await s3.send(new CreateMultipartUploadCommand({ Bucket: bucket, Key: key }));&#10;&#10;  // 2. 为每个 part 生成预签名 URL&#10;  const urls = await Promise.all(&#10;    Array.from({ length: totalParts }, (_, i) =&gt;&#10;      getSignedUrl(&#10;        s3,&#10;        new UploadPartCommand({&#10;          Bucket: bucket,&#10;          Key: key,&#10;          UploadId,&#10;          PartNumber: i + 1,&#10;        }),&#10;        { expiresIn: 3600 },&#10;      ),&#10;    ),&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return { uploadId: UploadId, partUrls: urls };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> initiateMultipartDirect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bucket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">totalParts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 1. 服务端创建 multipart upload</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UploadId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s3.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateMultipartUploadCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ Bucket: bucket, Key: key }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 2. 为每个 part 生成预签名 URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> urls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: totalParts }, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      getSignedUrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        s3,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UploadPartCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          Bucket: bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          Key: key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          UploadId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          PartNumber: i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { expiresIn: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { uploadId: UploadId, partUrls: urls };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>客户端拿到 URL 数组后并行上传各分片到 S3，最后将各 part 的 ETag 回传给应用服务器调用 <code>CompleteMultipartUpload</code>。这种模式结合了 <a href=\"chunked-resumable-upload\">分片与断点续传</a> 的可靠性与直传架构的带宽优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sts-临时凭证方案\">STS 临时凭证方案</h2><p>预签名 URL 的替代方案是向客户端签发 STS（Security Token Service）临时凭证，客户端使用临时 AK/SK 直接调用 SDK 上传。对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>预签名 URL</th>\n<th>STS 临时凭证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>粒度</td>\n<td>单个对象、单次操作</td>\n<td>一组权限策略、多次操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效期</td>\n<td>URL 级别（秒~小时）</td>\n<td>凭证级别（15分钟~12小时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端复杂度</td>\n<td>低（直接 HTTP PUT）</td>\n<td>高（需集成 SDK）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>单文件上传、分享链接</td>\n<td>批量上传、SDK 直传</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>每个 URL 权限固定</td>\n<td>可通过 Policy 精细控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"监控与问题排查\">监控与问题排查</h2><p>直传架构中故障排查的挑战在于数据路径不经过应用服务器，传统的 APM 无法抓取上传指标。应对策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>启用 S3 Server Access Logging / GCS Audit Log</li>\n<li>客户端 SDK 上报上传耗时、重试次数、失败原因</li>\n<li>对象存储 CloudWatch/Monitoring 指标：<code>4xxErrors</code>、<code>5xxErrors</code>、<code>FirstByteLatency</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于全链路可观测性的系统设计，参见 <a href=\"../security-reliability/upload-observability-debugging\">上传可观测性与问题排查</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>预签名 URL 将文件传输的带宽压力从应用服务器卸载到对象存储基础设施，是云原生文件上传的标准架构。核心取舍在于：获得了近乎无限的上传带宽扩展性，但增加了 CORS 配置、回调验证、安全约束（POST Policy / STS）等复杂度。对于大文件直传，可以结合预签名与分片上传——为每个分片生成独立的预签名 URL，兼得可靠性与带宽优势。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预签名 URL 与客户端直传","id":"预签名-url-与客户端直传"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"架构对比","id":"架构对比"},{"level":2,"text":"预签名 URL 的生成","id":"预签名-url-的生成"},{"level":3,"text":"AWS S3 签名机制","id":"aws-s3-签名机制"},{"level":3,"text":"GCS 签名 URL","id":"gcs-签名-url"},{"level":3,"text":"阿里云 OSS 签名 URL","id":"阿里云-oss-签名-url"},{"level":2,"text":"安全控制手段","id":"安全控制手段"},{"level":3,"text":"S3 POST Policy","id":"s3-post-policy"},{"level":3,"text":"CORS 配置","id":"cors-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"上传完成回调","id":"上传完成回调"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 客户端通知","id":"1-客户端通知"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 对象存储事件通知","id":"2-对象存储事件通知"},{"level":3,"text":"3. S3 Object Lambda / CloudFront Function","id":"3-s3-object-lambda-cloudfront-function"},{"level":2,"text":"预签名与分片上传的结合","id":"预签名与分片上传的结合"},{"level":2,"text":"STS 临时凭证方案","id":"sts-临时凭证方案"},{"level":2,"text":"监控与问题排查","id":"监控与问题排查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分片与断点续传","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/upload-fundamentals/chunked-resumable-upload"},"next":{"title":"流式 API 与背压控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/streaming-processing/stream-api-backpressure"}}